flowchart LR
  Pkg[Package installer] --> AG[asb-agent user]
  Pkg --> RG[asb-runner user]
  Pkg --> G[asb-runtime group]
  AG --> A[Agent]
  RG --> R[Runner]
  G --> S[(systemd-owned socket 0660)]
  A --> S
  R --> S
  R --> L[Windows suspended launcher]
  L -->|assign then resume| J[Per-run Job]
  J --> C[Computation and descendants]
  J -->|close or terminate| Stop[bounded teardown]
